      "slug": "gram:n3-maru-de-you",
      "variants": [],
      "steps_unavailable": "Circumfix around a pre-posed adverb. The record defines the pattern as まるで + term of comparison + ようだ/ように (まるで天使のように美しい) and states that まるで without the closing ようだ/みたい is incomplete, so both halves belong to the pattern. The closed op set has append but no prepend, so the まるで slot cannot be produced by an ordered build sequence. Steps covering only the trailing half would emit 天使のように, which is the plain ようだ/ように comparison entry, not this one, and would silently drop the element that marks the comparison as strong and non-literal.",
      "nuance_tags": ["comparison", "emphasis"],
      "usage_contexts": ["spoken", "written", "literary"]
